        {
          "resource_id": "monster_action",
          "stats": {
            "action_name": {
              "value": "Worry Prey"
            },
            "action_description": {
              "value": "(attack)\n\nRequirements The cu sith has a Large or smaller creature grabbed in its jaws; The cu sith viciously shakes its prey. The cu sith makes a jaws Strike against the grabbed creature with a +2 circumstance bonus to the attack roll. If the cu sith hits, it deals jaws damage, maintains its Grab, and attempts an Athletics check to Disarm its target of anything it is holding. On a miss, the cu sith releases the creature."
            },
